# UI tests in GatefoldUITests that no shard in .github/workflows/app.yml runs on main, each `Class[/test]<TAB>why`.
# scripts/ci-shards.py check fails when a UI test runs on main in no shard and isn't here, so a test leaves CI only by
# a visible line in this file; it also fails on a line that names no test, has no why, or names a test a shard runs.
CatchUpTabUITests	No shard ran it when this file was written (2026-11-27); no reason recorded. Add it to a shard, or record why.
DemoUITests	Drives the reader slowly for screen recordings; not a check. duo-tour.yml runs it on demand.
