HighlightUITests	No shard ran it when this file was written (2026-11-27); no reason recorded. Add it to a shard, or record why.
LiveSyncUITests	Runs against the real PocketBook Cloud on a test account; off unless the runner sets GATEFOLD_LIVE_EMAIL.
PageCountCostUITests	Measures what counting a book's pages costs; a measurement for comparing builds, not a check.
